WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.220
<i>Gavin...</i>

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.010
<i>Please...</i>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.260
<i>Please answer... Gavin!</i>

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.390
I can't connect to the net. 
What's up with that?

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.750
Probably a service outage. 
It's been happening a lot lately.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.190
<i>The customer you are trying to 
reach is currently unavailable.</i>

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:31.580
<i>Please leave a message after the tone.</i>

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:33.340
Gavin!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.510
Don't go to room 404 at the Greenwood Hotel!

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:38.750
It's dangerous!

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:43.060
I'll explain the details later, so just wait 
for me at the entrance of the hotel!

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>The world was rapidly changing its shape.</i>

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.090
<i>I still didn't know anything,</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.560
<i>but it's possible that part of me realized...</i>

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.390
<i>that the one at the center 
of everything going on</i>

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:05.060
<i>was none other than me.</i>

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:17.260
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:17.260
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:19.940
<i>"Queen."</i>

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.720
<i>The one who possesses her genes</i>

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.340
<i>can bless those who have 
special powers, Evolvers,</i>

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:27.620
<i>with even greater power, 
clearing a path to the future.</i>

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.790
<i>When the Queen truly awakens,</i>

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:33.230
<i>will the world achieve further evolution, or...</i>

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:53.020
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.480
"Room 404"

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:59.450
There isn't one?

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.340
What do you mean?

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:07.290
I'm very sorry. Our hotel 
does not have a room 404.

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:12.040
Is it possible you had one 
before, but it's gone now?

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.750
Or that there are plans to build one?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.570
Unfortunately, no...

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.250
Pardon me for asking,

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:22.240
but is it possible you've mistaken 
our hotel for a different one?

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.890
Would you mind if I took 
a look at your fourth floor?

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:33.070
Access to our guest floors is 
limited to those staying with us.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.540
I'll stay here, then!

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.880
Do you have a room 
available on the fourth floor?

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:04.270
<i>The Greenwood Hotel doesn't have a room 404.</i>

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:08.160
<i>If that's true, then... 
was all that just an illusion?</i>

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:05.950
I never imagined you'd 
show up instead of Gavin.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.030
You're...

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.160
<i>The one who'd gone missing...</i>

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.780
<i>A Black Swan agent, Jay's little sister.</i>

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.710
<i>I think her name was...</i>

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.790
<i>Josie.</i>

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.340
Why are you here?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.110
Where is Gavin?

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:26.340
I suppose this is good, in its own way.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.430
Before killing Gavin...

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.640
I'll kill you first.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.310
I'll show you the despair

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.020
of losing someone dear to you.

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:58.340
This is one of several places in the world

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:02.420
where a different space-time was born 
from variations in cosmic energy.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:13.350
Seventeen years ago, 
my family wandered into this place.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:17.560
The only ones who made it back to
 our world were Jay-niisan and me.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.690
But now my brother is gone, too...

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.940
He was killed! Because of you and Gavin!

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:28.570
If it weren't for you two...

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.790
Your death will not be swift.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:44.170
I'll make sure you feel the same 
agony my brother and I experienced.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.400
<i>Stay calm.</i>

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.510
<i>At least this way...</i>

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.690
<i>That future will have changed.</i>

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.710
<i>All that's left is to somehow help her...</i>

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:58.810
Are you here because you were 
ordered by Black Swan?

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:05.020
Those people used us to their 
hearts' content, and in the end...

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.150
they never helped us.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.240
Then... Gavin and the Evolver 
Anti-Crime Task Force...

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:16.290
They take Evolvers like you under 
their protection to save them!

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:17.870
Protection?

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.780
You don't know anything, do you?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.080
And you're supposed to be the Queen.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.400
Another service outage.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.580
<i>There've been intermittent service outages</i>

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.950
<i>around Loveland City over the past few days.</i>

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.280
<i>The service providers have
 been handling them,</i>

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:41.700
<i>but the cause is unknown.</i>

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:46.380
<i>There's been intel that Black Swan has 
initiated action on a large-scale plan.</i>

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.360
<i>It's doubtful that it's related...</i>

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:54.620
<i>But the only lead is Black Swan 
Agent Jay's younger sister, Josie.</i>

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:58.170
<i>She was reported missing, 
but in the last few days,</i>

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:02.380
<i>she's been frequently sighted in the 
vicinity of the Greenwood Hotel.</i>

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:12.650
<i>I will protect you. No matter what.</i>

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.960
<i>Both you... and this city.</i>

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:19.900
Litton...

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.930
Thanks for coming here.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.620
Where have you been all this time?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:33.690
All Commander Leto would tell me is 
that you went missing during a mission.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.260
I just assumed you were...

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.740
What happened?

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.650
You've been looking into the 
whereabouts of the Evolvers that

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.960
the Task Force has taken 
into protection, right?

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:50.960
A few of the people you 
interviewed had connections to me.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:55.610
That's why I got in touch... 
so I could tell you the truth.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.510
A part of you already knows, though, right?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:05.680
All the Evolvers that the Task Force 
has taken in have been killed.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:07.890
It didn't matter if they'd done harm

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:10.490
or if they'd simply been caught up in events.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.230
All of them.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.800
They made me carry out that "work" for them.

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.740
I couldn't take it anymore, so I ran away.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:23.410
All we are is executioners.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:20.080
Further whereabouts unknown

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:20.780
Further whereabouts unknown

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:21.830
whereabouts unknown

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.620
For what reason...

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:29.750
Why would the Task Force 
do something like that?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.000
I don't know.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.660
It's all done according to
 Commander Leto's judgement.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.480
Gavin, be careful.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:41.230
He's vigilant and meticulous.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:43.600
If he notices what you're doing, he'll...

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.000
Litton!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.410
Stay with me, Litton!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.940
You two were both outstanding investigators.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.260
It is unfortunate that we find 
ourselves in this situation.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.540
Commander Leto...

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.880
Why?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.440
We're supposed to protect people.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:25.220
Why hurt Evolvers... and the 
people who fight alongside us?

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.390
Where is the justice in this?!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:33.020
It is our job to defend order in this world, 
using whatever means necessary.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:37.070
Though you may not be 
able to understand yet.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.700
I don't want to understand.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.270
Litton! I'll help you.

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:45.840
Go...

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.430
The clues...

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:53.970
Black Swan... this town... the people...

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.730
Fire!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.820
Where'd he go?

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:09.540
After him!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.510
You okay?

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.310
Yeah.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.730
The result may be the same anyway.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.080
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:30.080
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:34.220
Yes.

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:37.880
I have seen this guest several times.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.340
I'd like to investigate 
the places she stopped by.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.250
Would you mind showing me right now?

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.720
Just a moment, please.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.870
<i>Her rage at the murder 
of her older brother, Jay,</i>

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.020
<i>may have led her to enact 
some kind of extreme plan.</i>

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:55.640
<i>I have to stop her before it gets serious...</i>

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:02.630
<i>You have one message.</i>

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.910
<i>Today at 4:05 P.M.</i>

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:08.490
<i>Gavin!</i>

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.980
<i>Don't go to room 404 at the Greenwood Hotel!</i>

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.530
<i>It's dangerous!</i>

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:17.830
<i>I'll explain the details later, so just wait 
for me at the entrance of the hotel!</i>

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.180
Excuse me.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:28.740
I'd like to investigate room 404. 
Is there a guest staying there?

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:34.060
Well... Our hotel does not have a room 404.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:34.980
It doesn't exist?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.200
That's correct.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:40.310
Although another guest, 
who reserved a room earlier,

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:43.650
was also asking whether we had a room 404.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.500
Mom!

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.890
If you were at all competent,

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:21.360
you would have been 
able to save your mother.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.980
You killed your mother.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.820
You should never have been born.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.870
<i>Right now, I need to gather 
whatever information I can</i>

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.710
<i>and find my chance to escape from here.</i>

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:41.300
What is this "Queen"?

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.790
What do you people hope to achieve

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:47.240
by just doing these same things over and over?

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:53.220
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.180
The Red Queen hypothesis...

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:58.110
You know of it?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.810
Species that give up on
 progressing toward the future

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:05.680
are fated to go extinct 
through natural selection.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.300
Humanity is no exception.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:12.410
Accomplishing further evolution 
and achieving greater existence

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.650
is the only way to remain at 
the apex of the natural world.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:22.590
Black Swan believes that Evolvers 
are the end result of this evolution,

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.700
and thus has continued to study them.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:29.010
Then they discovered an entirely unique gene.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:33.680
A being that awakens Evolvers and 
grants them even greater powers,

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.360
guiding the way to further evolution...

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.310
The Queen.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.990
My power went out of control.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:45.400
Even considering my highly emotional 
state, that has never happened.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.860
A life in peril will struggle with all its might

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:55.540
to increase its chance of survival 
by even the smallest margin.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.750
That struggle will awaken a new power.

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:02.540
That's why you're after my life...

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.850
If you die, that's the end.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:09.590
But if you survive, and I manage 
to awaken your true power...

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.840
Everything that's happened...

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.930
It was all to make me the Queen?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.960
That's right. It's all your fault.

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:25.150
It's because of <i>you</i> that everyone
 else got caught up in it.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.440
Your father, too!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:33.730
It's all because <i>you</i> have the Queen's genes!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:41.870
Once, you were the one person 
here I could call a rival.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:45.130
As you are now, you disappoint me.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:49.480
My plan has already 
reached the execution stage.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:54.550
The Queen's genes will allow
humanity to reach new heights,

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.720
and the one standing at the peak will be...

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:01.180
You're saying you have such power?

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:03.250
You'll see in time.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:06.900
You can stand there and watch from
 the sidelines, biting your nails with envy.

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:10.240
My preference...

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.330
is to obliterate thieves, you know.

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.450
I'm quite narrow-minded, you see.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:22.320
We went to a lot of pains for this creation. 
We can't let it lie unused, can we?

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:26.500
I've created a magnum opus.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:44.310
I'm not like I was back then. Not anymore!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.250
Wait for me!

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.480
<i>This is the Queen?</i>

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:54.900
<i>For someone like this, my brother was...</i>

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.170
This is the end!

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.240
And I'll send Gavin to you soon, too!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:04.230
You can cry, "I'm sorry for 
getting you caught up in this,"

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.670
all you want in the afterlife!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.300
I won't...

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.900
let you do that!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.750
Q-Queen!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.480
Gavin!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.460
Because of you...

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.620
Because of both of you,

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.760
my brother is...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.240
Your rage is justified.

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:47.170
The justice we believed in was a lie.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:51.180
But I have things I must protect.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:53.760
I won't let them be taken from me again!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.180
Leave now.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.380
Gavin...

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:12.870
"A family of four who should have been 
at their home suddenly disappeared,

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:16.610
and they were found in the mountains 
a few dozen kilometers away."

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.400
Follow the sound of the waterfall!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:22.120
We might be able to find a way out there.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.290
This is...

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:33.200
This is the truth behind the incident 
Papa had been chasing, isn't it?

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.760
Gavin...

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:38.260
There's something Josie said...

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.310
about the Evolver Anti-Crime 
Task Force and Jay...

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.560
Yes. It's true.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.840
It's all right.

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:52.980
You don't have to worry about anything.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.590
But...

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.900
I'm all right.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.660
What was that?

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:09.910
Gavin?

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:16.630
Stay back!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:21.720
I don't want you... 
getting caught up in this...

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.870
<i>There is no need to feel remorse,</i>

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.450
<i>for this is the beginning,</i>

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.120
<i>O she who carries the Queen's genes.</i>

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:55.860
<i>With the Queen's awakening, 
humanity greets its moment of evolution.</i>

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:59.260
<i>But it is also a time of culling.</i>

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.930
Those who cannot adapt to the new world

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.440
have no choice but to perish 
as the vanquished.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.470
That is the rule of nature.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.500
<i>That is exactly the way, Queen.</i>

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:16.650
<i>Keep running!</i>

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:19.570
<i>Those steps are what shall change the world.</i>

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.980
<i>My name is Hades.</i>

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:25.280
<i>Until the day you truly awaken...</i>

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:29.760
Really?

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.330
Kiro, are you all right?

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:36.600
It's nothing. I'm fine.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:41.390
Kiro... My Kiro...

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.260
Kiro belongs to me!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.260
You there! Stop!

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.540
Don't make me laugh! He belongs to me!

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:50.570
Get back!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.980
I can't make it... stop...

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:56.000
I-It's not like that, Ares. I just...

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.400
I just wanted to avenge my brother.

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:01.060
I never meant to get in your way!

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:05.970
Don't... Anything but that!

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:08.640
Don't send me there, pl—

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.390
Quite an offense to the ears.

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:24.590
<i>The anxiety that grows within me...</i>

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:27.750
<i>Butterflies use their wings to fly away,</i>

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:30.380
<i>no matter how you try to tie them down.</i>

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:31.880
<i>Episode nine,</i>

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:33.110
<i>"Monochrome."</i>

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:35.050
"Monochrome"
